Z||000008||ka4nkf||03-25-2000||10:07 PM||||Back to your question. If you raise the trunk you will see two round spots under the trunk lid one on each side. This is where the factory spoiler is mounted. Holes are drilled in the middle of thes two spots. It is hard for me to describe but maybe you will understand. good luck||||reg||1
